    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "When 16 is subtracted from half of $q$, the result is less than 18. What values can $q$ take?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$q<68$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{q}{2}-16&<18\\\\\\frac{q}{2}&<34\\\\q&<68\\end{align*}$$\n\nAdd 16 to both sides, then multiply both sides by 2. The inequality sign stays the same because 2 is positive.",
